00:37:38.840 --> 00:37:42.200
So that does the
data get related

00:37:42.200 --> 00:37:45.260
whenever a new user
opens the web address

00:37:45.260 --> 00:37:49.850
and that's going to
depend on where you've

00:37:49.850 --> 00:37:52.740
put that action in your code.

00:37:52.740 --> 00:37:58.160
So you definitely don't want to
reload the data for every user

00:37:58.160 --> 00:38:05.420
and you probably want to try to
utilize a drill down approach

00:38:05.420 --> 00:38:12.290
for exposing access to
more data as it's required

00:38:12.290 --> 00:38:15.000
for that user if possible.

